  "created": "2026-10-14T20:39:04.72Z",
  "description": "建構在 Ozakboy.Http 之上的 Telegram Bot 告警推播,取代 Telegram.Bot:訊息分級(Info / Warning / Critical)顯示在開頭、超過 4096 字元依行切分且不切斷字素、純文字送出不因跳脫字元被拒、依 System.Threading.RateLimiting 做每聊天節流、429 依回應中的 retry_after 等待後重送、暫時性失敗「至少送達一次」。Bot 權杖位於網址路徑,本套件把它登記為 Ozakboy.Http 管線的已知祕密(管線移除 HttpClientFactory 預設日誌,記下的位址遮罩權杖),並在所有回傳的錯誤(訊息、資料、例外)上再遮罩一次。所有預期失敗以 Result 表達。除 Microsoft 官方套件與 Ozakboy.* 自研套件外,零第三方相依。Telegram Bot alerting built on Ozakboy.Http, replacing Telegram.Bot: levelled messages, line-aware splitting at 4096 characters that never breaks a grapheme, plain-text delivery that cannot be rejected over escaping, per-chat throttling on System.Threading.RateLimiting, 429 handling that honours retry_after, and at-least-once retry of transient failures. The bot token lives in the URL path, so the package registers it as a known secret on its Ozakboy.Http pipeline, which removes HttpClientFactory's default request logging and masks the token in the URIs it logs, and redacts it again from every error it returns.",
