  "releaseNotes": "0.1.0 (2026-10-15) — First release. ITelegramNotifier / TelegramNotifier returning Result; Info / Warning / Critical levels with a Critical priority lane; plain-text only; grapheme-safe splitting over 4096 characters; per-chat throttling on System.Threading.RateLimiting; 429 retry_after handling; at-least-once retry of transient failures; bot token registered as a known secret and redacted from every error. Full changelog: https://github.com/ozakboy/Ozakboy.Notify.Telegram/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
